WEBVTT

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:02.116
AG: Your antidote to burnout
is not necessarily less work.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.026
It could be more meaning.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:06.289
What was clever about
Conrey's weekend tutoring

00:11:06.313 --> 00:11:08.790
was that it reconnected her
to why she chose teaching

00:11:08.814 --> 00:11:09.970
in the first place.

00:11:09.994 --> 00:11:12.449
It enabled her to step
out of the grind for a moment

00:11:12.473 --> 00:11:13.926
and see her impact,

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:16.627
which is something you
can do in any kind of job.

00:11:16.651 --> 00:11:19.176
(Music)

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:21.105
In a study of hundreds of professionals

00:11:21.129 --> 00:11:24.046
keeping daily diaries
across multiple industries,

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:26.736
the single strongest predictor
of engagement at work

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:29.037
was a sense of daily progress.

00:11:29.414 --> 00:11:30.810
What that means in practice